💓💓💓Objectives
The main objectives of this project are:

- Analyze plot productivity based on average crop yield
- Measure irrigation usage across all plots
- Compare crop performance under different weather conditions
- Identify top performing plots by soil type
- Evaluate farmer level water efficiency
- Track harvest activity over time
- Detect low efficiency plots for optimization

